#: killbots/rulesets/full.desktop:7
msgid ""
"Description=<qt>"
"<p>A testing game configuration, not intended to be playable. Used to test the "
"board-full-on-new-round logic.</p>"
"<p>A 18 by 10 cell grid that is quite full of enemies initially, but 60 more "
"are added for the second round guaranteeing the board will be full.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""

